  "offset": 28,
  "lyrics": [
    {"start":1.67,"end":3.82,"text":"Mga kababayan","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":5.02,"end":5.87,"text":"Turn up!","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":8.04,"end":9.85,"text":"Tayo'y Pilipino","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":9.85,"end":13.34,"text":"Kahit anong kulay ng balat, isasapuso","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":13.34,"end":16.75,"text":"Mapa-Tagalog, Bisaya, o Ilokano","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":16.75,"end":20.14,"text":"Walang tatalo sa bagsik ng ating dugo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":20.14,"end":23.55,"text":"Isigaw nang malakas ang ating panalo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":23.55,"end":27.94,"text":"'Wag nang pag-usapan ang mga negatibong pangyayari","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":27.94,"end":30.47,"text":"Sa'n mang panig ka nasa mundo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":30.47,"end":34.61,"text":"Kinabukasan na natin 'to, panalo!","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":35.15,"end":39.54,"text":"Listen, yuh, I still remember when I was a kid and there was a duality","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":39.54,"end":42.9,"text":"Comparing myself to a hero that already made it like that's my reality","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":42.9,"end":46.29,"text":"Forget all the sanity Imma just do it myself just to double the salary","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":46.29,"end":50.17,"text":"And y'all would just laugh at me when I am the one that can thank my mama happily bro","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":50.17,"end":52.81,"text":"People no giggles 'cause I make y'all proud of me bro","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":52.81,"end":56.25,"text":"Name another EZ Mil or Manny initials alone that can Pac on the shows","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":56.25,"end":59.66,"text":"'Cause I'm sick of freakin sittin bickering bout all the money, tat and the clothes","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":59.66,"end":63.77,"text":"So I'll spit into existence with these witty fists Imma flack to the globe","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":63.77,"end":67.09,"text":"Y'all jabbin' at me, Imma clap back with a hook","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":67.09,"end":70.33,"text":"But if both ain't knockin you out here's an uppercut in a book","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":70.33,"end":72.05,"text":"Unorthodox but no rookie","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":72.05,"end":73.65,"text":"Southpaw to a bully","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":73.65,"end":77.06,"text":"Not a single soul know so Imma believe in a folly","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":77.06,"end":78.93,"text":"These bars never done, uh","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":78.93,"end":80.58,"text":"Three stars and a sun, aye","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":80.58,"end":82.33,"text":"Blue, red draped down on a flag","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":82.33,"end":83.57,"text":"No, we never fear none","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":83.57,"end":85.38,"text":"Most of us didn't grow up with a trust fund","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":85.38,"end":87.06,"text":"Know that I'm willin' to kill for a loved one","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":87.06,"end":88.49,"text":"I'm on the move from a nothin' to someone","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":88.49,"end":90.06,"text":"Reminding my people to shout","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":90.25,"end":92.18,"text":"Tayo'y Pilipino","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":92.18,"end":95.61,"text":"Kahit anong kulay ng balat, isasapuso","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":95.61,"end":99.05,"text":"Mapa-Tagalog, Bisaya, o Ilokano","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":99.05,"end":102.57,"text":"Walang tatalo sa bagsik ng ating dugo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":102.57,"end":105.85,"text":"Isigaw nang malakas ang ating panalo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":105.85,"end":110.33,"text":"'Wag nang pag-usapan ang mga negatibong pangyayari","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":110.33,"end":112.58,"text":"Sa'n mang panig ka nasa mundo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":112.58,"end":115.51,"text":"Kinabukasan na natin 'to","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":115.51,"end":116.49,"text":"Panalo!","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":116.61,"end":117.35,"text":"Ey","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":118.58,"end":121.67,"text":"Kung inakala mong isang lenggwahe lang kayang gamitin ni Ez Mil","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":121.67,"end":123.59,"text":"'La kang mapapala kung ganyan ka magisip","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":123.59,"end":124.67,"text":"Kay Bathala ka sisingil","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":124.67,"end":126.89,"text":"Utang na galing sa loob na lumutang","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":126.89,"end":129.73,"text":"Hinain sa turon na may pusang sinaing sa","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":129.73,"end":130.79,"text":"Ano?","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":130.79,"end":131.29,"text":"Okey!","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":131.29,"end":134.48,"text":"Uray no nga imbagak kinyayo ti ukkinayo","lang":"ilo"},
    {"start":134.48,"end":138.32,"text":"Dittoy ak laeng ag-ururay no sinno ti agdayo","lang":"ilo"},
    {"start":138.32,"end":141.45,"text":"Kasla ni Chavit denggem am amin kinyami nga payo","lang":"ilo"},
    {"start":141.45,"end":144.41,"text":"Ngata kay-kayatem nga patayeng ka ken atoy bayo","lang":"ilo"},
    {"start":145.43,"end":146.96,"text":"Di ko bisaya pero sulayan nako","lang":"ceb"},
    {"start":146.96,"end":148.54,"text":"Ilansang ta'ka ug dawaton na nimo","lang":"ceb"},
    {"start":148.54,"end":150.04,"text":"Kay imo'ng baba nga sama sa iro","lang":"ceb"},
    {"start":150.04,"end":152.14,"text":"Murag kumo ni Pacquiao kung 'kaw'ng maigo","lang":"ceb"},
    {"start":152.14,"end":155.32,"text":"Makauli ka'g wala naka'y dungog nga mura kag bungog","lang":"ceb"},
    {"start":155.72,"end":158.05,"text":"Muana pa'ko nga ako ang bag-o nga nawong sa karun","lang":"ceb"},
    {"start":158.27,"end":159,"text":"And I swear that:","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":159,"end":160.53,"text":"Nobody will ever look at me the same way again","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":160.53,"end":162.35,"text":"I'll make it to the top while I be showin' nay-sayers and","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":162.35,"end":164.78,"text":"Nanalo na ako nung una pa na pinugutan si Lapu sa Mactan","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":164.78,"end":166.7,"text":"At lahat ang nasaktan na nalaman nila na pinatay","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":166.7,"end":171.13,"text":"Ang kanilang bayani sa karagatan ng bansa na pag-aari ng Pilipino","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":171.13,"end":173.03,"text":"Despite any turmoil","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":173.03,"end":174.67,"text":"I'll be proud of my soil","lang":"eng"},
    {"start":174.67,"end":175.71,"text":"Bakit? Kase","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":175.71,"end":177.87,"text":"Tayo'y Pilipino","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":177.87,"end":181.32,"text":"Kahit anong kulay ng balat, isasapuso","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":181.32,"end":184.83,"text":"Mapa-Tagalog, Bisaya, o Ilokano","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":184.83,"end":188.19,"text":"Walang tatalo sa bagsik ng ating dugo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":188.19,"end":191.59,"text":"Isigaw nang malakas ang ating panalo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":191.59,"end":195.95,"text":"'Wag nang pag-usapan ang mga negatibong pangyayari","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":195.95,"end":198.39,"text":"Sa'n mang panig ka nasa mundo","lang":"tgl"},
    {"start":198.39,"end":204.21,"text":"Kinabukasan na natin 'to, panalo!","lang":"tgl"}
  ],
